  "description": "Compile-time binary message serialization for .NET — built for game servers, networking, and other allocation-sensitive applications.\n\nDeclare partial message classes with [Message]; the included Roslyn source generator emits Serialize/Deserialize code, and message types self-register on module load. No reflection on the hot path, no runtime codegen, no manual registration. Supports message inheritance families (Parent/Child), hash-derived or manual message IDs, a compact little-endian wire format, and pooled-buffer send paths.\n\nTargets netstandard2.1 (Unity-compatible) and net6.0+. This single package installs everything: MessageProtocol.Core (runtime) and MessageProtocol.CodeGenerator (source generator) come in as dependencies.",
